# App empty copy

## Two surfaces only

1. **Status line** — in-flow hint while the page still has structure (`CatalogStatusLine`, `OsAppChromePageStatus`). One short sentence. No icon. Stable line box (`min-height`) so looking ↔ no-matches swaps do not shove below.
2. **True empty** — compose `market-page-empty` or `standing-panel-empty-state` (+ optional `OsEmptyAction`). Do not invent a third empty tree.

## Stable first paint

Paint personal bands as soon as their data is ready (Market Yours stays independent of browse). If an empty-browse hint may still arrive above that band, reserve the `CatalogStatusLine` box — do not delay the band. Morph looking → no matches in the same slot. Do not leave a reserved gap when the hint will never show.

## Voice

Shared universals live in `@/lib/empty-copy` (`noMatches`, `nothingHereYet`, …). Domain lines stay local and human (`No fans yet.`, feed lens empties).

## Do not

- Slap a decorative Mage glyph (e.g. cup-hot) on every empty
- Turn status hints into hero empty cards when content continues below
- Hand-roll underlined recovery links — use `OsEmptyAction`
- Block Yours / vault paint on browse or sales RPC just to avoid CLS
